# `math` → `ecma:math`. This binds every name ECMA spells the same way
# (`hypot`, `atan2`, `log2`, …) with no per-name row. Names where the
# spellings differ (`pi` vs `PI`) or that are profile builtins (`sqrt` →
# `opcode:f64_sqrt`) are handled earlier, at walk time, by the named-import
# rewrite in the walker — so both mechanisms cover their own half.
